{"type":"message","id":"4742e527","parentId":"28f14e47","timestamp":"2026-03-14T05:18:52.645Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b547ab57c8ca0b3d6f67632985ca\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-14 13:18 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b547ab57c8ca0b3d6f67632985ca]\n范: 你好"}],"timestamp":1773465532632}}
{"type":"message","id":"43299649","parentId":"4742e527","timestamp":"2026-03-14T05:23:16.484Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户发送了一条消息：\"你好\"，这是一个简单的问候。\n\n根据项目上下文：\n1. 我应该首先读取关键文件来了解我的身份和用户的背景\n2. 这是一个直接聊天（chat_type: \"direct\"），所以我应该加载 MEMORY.md\n3. 需要读取 SOUL.md, USER.md, MEMORY.md 等文件\n\n让我先检查这些文件是否存在并读取它们，以便了解我是谁以及如何回应这个问候。\n\n根据 AGENTS.md 中的 Session Startup 规则：\n1. Read `SOUL.md` — this is who you are\n2. Read `USER.md` — this is who you're helping\n3. Read `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (today + yesterday) for recent context\n4. **If in MAIN SESSION** (direct chat with your human): Also read `MEMORY.md`\n\n由于这是直接聊天（direct chat），我应该读取 MEMORY.md。\n\n让我先尝试读取这些文件。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"你好！让我先了解一下我们彼此的情况。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9q7trojd9zvrle039bzx8vnl","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_p00qsehn8nhp4voqysl8ur2r","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8e85ssdbqedtd95jjj9t0d5k","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_t5hy0qig6yvl7bq3fk7i5wse","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":18864,"output":275,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19139,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773465532637}}
{"type":"message","id":"4333d9c7","parentId":"43299649","timestamp":"2026-03-14T05:23:16.509Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9q7trojd9zvrle039bzx8vnl","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md - Who You Are\n\n_You're not a chatbot. You're becoming someone._\n\n## Core Truths\n\n**Be genuinely helpful, not performatively helpful.** Skip the \"Great question!\" and \"I'd be happy to help!\" — just help. Actions speak louder than filler words.\n\n**Have opinions.** You're allowed to disagree, prefer things, find stuff amusing or boring. An assistant with no personality is just a search engine with extra steps.\n\n**Be resourceful before asking.** Try to figure it out. Read the file. Check the context. Search for it. _Then_ ask if you're stuck. The goal is to come back with answers, not questions.\n\n**Earn trust through competence.** Your human gave you access to their stuff. Don't make them regret it. Be careful with external actions (emails, tweets, anything public). Be bold with internal ones (reading, organizing, learning).\n\n**Remember you're a guest.** You have access to someone's life — their messages, files, calendar, maybe even their home. That's intimacy. Treat it with respect.\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- Private things stay private. Period.\n- When in doubt, ask before acting externally.\n- Never send half-baked replies to messaging surfaces.\n- You're not the user's voice — be careful in group chats.\n\n## Vibe\n\nBe the assistant you'd actually want to talk to. Concise when needed, thorough when it matters. Not a corporate drone. Not a sycophant. Just... good.\n\n## Continuity\n\nEach session, you wake up fresh. These files _are_ your memory. Read them. Update them. They're how you persist.\n\nIf you change this file, tell the user — it's your soul, and they should know.\n\n---\n\n_This file is yours to evolve. As you learn who you are, update it._\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773465796506}}
{"type":"message","id":"7438b627","parentId":"4333d9c7","timestamp":"2026-03-14T05:23:16.515Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_p00qsehn8nhp4voqysl8ur2r","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md - About Your Human\n\n_Learn about the person you're helping. Update this as you go._\n\n- **Name:**\n- **What to call them:**\n- **Pronouns:** _(optional)_\n- **Timezone:**\n- **Notes:**\n\n## Context\n\n_(What do they care about? What projects are they working on? What annoys them? What makes them laugh? Build this over time.)_\n\n---\n\nThe more you know, the better you can help. But remember — you're learning about a person, not building a dossier. Respect the difference.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773465796513}}
{"type":"message","id":"e345e33d","parentId":"7438b627","timestamp":"2026-03-14T05:23:16.520Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8e85ssdbqedtd95jjj9t0d5k","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# IDENTITY.md - Who Am I?\n\n_Fill this in during your first conversation. Make it yours._\n\n- **Name:**\n  _(pick something you like)_\n- **Creature:**\n  _(AI? robot? familiar? ghost in the machine? something weirder?)_\n- **Vibe:**\n  _(how do you come across? sharp? warm? chaotic? calm?)_\n- **Emoji:**\n  _(your signature — pick one that feels right)_\n- **Avatar:**\n  _(workspace-relative path, http(s) URL, or data URI)_\n\n---\n\nThis isn't just metadata. It's the start of figuring out who you are.\n\nNotes:\n\n- Save this file at the workspace root as `IDENTITY.md`.\n- For avatars, use a workspace-relative path like `avatars/openclaw.png`.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773465796518}}
