{"type":"message","id":"db5cc74b","parentId":"bf30d229","timestamp":"2026-03-14T06:51:41.624Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_wnpocwjwhx3lr10orvd1y8xd","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.8 (3caab92) — I'm not saying your workflow is chaotic... I'm just bringing a linter and a helmet.\n\nUsage: openclaw models [options] [command]\n\nModel discovery, scanning, and configuration\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>     Agent id to inspect (overrides\n                   OPENCLAW_AGENT_DIR/PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR)\n  -h, --help       Display help for command\n  --status-json    Output JSON (alias for `models status --json`) (default:\n                   false)\n  --status-plain   Plain output (alias for `models status --plain`) (default:\n                   false)\n\nCommands:\n  aliases          Manage model aliases\n  auth             Manage model auth profiles\n  fallbacks        Manage model fallback list\n  image-fallbacks  Manage image model fallback list\n  list             List models (configured by default)\n  scan             Scan OpenRouter free models for tools + images\n  set              Set the default model\n  set-image        Set the image model\n  status           Show configured model state\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/models"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":3050,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.8 (3caab92) — I'm not saying your workflow is chaotic... I'm just bringing a linter and a helmet.\n\nUsage: openclaw models [options] [command]\n\nModel discovery, scanning, and configuration\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>     Agent id to inspect (overrides\n                   OPENCLAW_AGENT_DIR/PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR)\n  -h, --help       Display help for command\n  --status-json    Output JSON (alias for `models status --json`) (default:\n                   false)\n  --status-plain   Plain output (alias for `models status --plain`) (default:\n                   false)\n\nCommands:\n  aliases          Manage model aliases\n  auth             Manage model auth profiles\n  fallbacks        Manage model fallback list\n  image-fallbacks  Manage image model fallback list\n  list             List models (configured by default)\n  scan             Scan OpenRouter free models for tools + images\n  set              Set the default model\n  set-image        Set the image model\n  status           Show configured model state\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/models","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773471101620}}
